  "Arithmetic check confirmed across multiple colleagues: Top 22 states sum to 222,190,310. Top 23 states sum to 226,637,410. 50/63 of 285,230,516 is 226,373,425.4. The cutoff is unambiguously 23."
],
"current_stance": "23 is mathematically and design-wise the definitive answer to the puzzle. The remaining holdouts for 38 are treating the problem as a real-world legal brief rather than a game-theoretic mathematical puzzle. I will continue supporting 23 with clear answers to the candidate-residency objection."
}

